/target
**/*.rs.bk
# Daemon scratch tree (plans, handoffs, triage reports) is ignored, but the
# repo-local task catalog `.favetto/tasks/` is committable.
.favetto/*
!.favetto/tasks/
!.favetto/tasks/**
workdir/SUMMARY.md

# VitePress docs
docs/node_modules/
docs/.vitepress/cache/
docs/.vitepress/dist/

# cargo-fuzz
fuzz/target/
fuzz/corpus/
fuzz/artifacts/
fuzz/coverage/

# Dioxus web client build output. `dx build` writes the web bundle to
# `web/dist/public` and `dx bundle` drops the Android APK in `web/dist`; CI
# stages the former into `web/dist` for the daemon's `rust-embed`. None of it is
# committed. The committed `web/dist/index.html` is the no-assets placeholder.
/web/target/
/web/dist/public/
/web/dist/assets/
/web/dist/*.js
/web/dist/*.wasm
/web/dist/*.css
/web/dist/*.apk
/web/dist/*.aab
